{"verse_key": "10:106", "surah": 10, "verse": 106, "text_uthmani": "وَلَا تَدْعُ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ مَا لَا يَنفَعُكَ وَلَا يَضُرُّكَ ۖ فَإِن فَعَلْتَ فَإِنَّكَ إِذًا مِّنَ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "translation": "And do not invoke<sup foot_note=196464>1</sup> besides Allāh that which neither benefits you nor harms you, for if you did, then indeed you would be of the wrongdoers.'\"<sup foot_note=196463>2</sup>", "verse_from_ms": 2255190, "verse_to_ms": 2270810, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَلَا", "start_ms": 2255190, "end_ms": 2256180}, {"i": 1, "text": "تَدْعُ", "start_ms": 2256180, "end_ms": 2256920}, {"i": 2, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 2256920, "end_ms": 2257560}, {"i": 3, "text": "دُونِ", "start_ms": 2257560, "end_ms": 2258110}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 2258110, "end_ms": 2258890}, {"i": 5, "text": "مَا", "start_ms": 2258890, "end_ms": 2259270}, {"i": 6, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 2259270, "end_ms": 2259630}, {"i": 7, "text": "يَنفَعُكَ", "start_ms": 2259630, "end_ms": 2261110}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَلَا", "start_ms": 2261110, "end_ms": 2261630}, {"i": 9, "text": "يَضُرُّكَ", "start_ms": 2261630, "end_ms": 2262710}, {"i": 10, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 2262710, "end_ms": 2263690}, {"i": 11, "text": "فَإِن", "start_ms": 2263690, "end_ms": 2264550}, {"i": 12, "text": "فَعَلْتَ", "start_ms": 2264550, "end_ms": 2265880}, {"i": 13, "text": "فَإِنَّكَ", "start_ms": 2265880, "end_ms": 2266340}, {"i": 14, "text": "إِذًا", "start_ms": 2266340, "end_ms": 2267280}, {"i": 15, "text": "مِّنَ", "start_ms": 2267280, "end_ms": 2270335}, {"i": 16, "text": "ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}